{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The metric socket screws and lag bolt assortment fit my repeated interest in fastening supplies for practical assembly work.",
    "The carbide burr set could complement my drilling and cutting supplies by helping me shape metal and clean up edges, provided it fits my tools."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Decorative filament and UV printer resin require printing equipment and projects that my history does not establish; tabletop epoxy serves a different purpose.",
    "Water-testing strips, specimen bags and scented cleaner do not support the fastening, measuring and fabrication work reflected in my recent choices."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The recommendations seem to treat broadly related workshop and laboratory supplies as interchangeable, even when they solve very different problems.",
    "My interest in tabletop resin seems to have been stretched into an interest in printing materials without evidence that I use a 3D printer."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "Exact dimensions, thread sizes and tool compatibility determine whether a seemingly relevant accessory is actually useful to me.",
    "I have already bought several hardware assortments, so another bulk pack needs to fill a specific gap; relevance alone does not mean I need it now."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my fastening and fabrication interests but sometimes mistake a shared material or broad supply connection for a current project need."
}"}
